Valnes WebLock app allows you to open doors over the net.

Download the Valnes WebLock app if you own a Valnes WebLock or if you have received an invitation to use a Valnes WebLock.

Delegation of access to users is done via management console (https://login.valnes.ee).

Features:
• Sign up a user;
• Open doors via internet;
• Insert app keys to gain access to doors;
• Ability to monitor the current door state (open/closed) assuming that hall sensor or door sensor is installed. 

Read more about the features on www.valnes.com
